        <mxCell id="lg4" value="Sprint 1 created every table. Sprint 2 added no table, but did add the signature and link columns to the two chained tables and the constraints that keep those chains linear.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK primary key · FK foreign key&lt;br&gt;1 exactly one · 0..1 at most one · * many" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
